{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさん笑いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただね、口内炎が\n下唇の内側の左右両方にできちゃって\n楽しくお話し中にも関わらず\n噛んでしまうと\n途中で死んだ目をしちゃう(｡ρω-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～いたいよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビタミンB2飲んでるけどね、\nお父さんがビタミンB2飲ませたがりの人なんだけど、それにしても自分から結構飲むようになったんだけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのにできたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひく前なのかな？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット帽見切れてるけど\n色違いで買ったの～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな帽子を試してかぶりながら\nお互いかぶったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「似合うでしょ～♪」って\n見せ合いっこしてたの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は大事なお仕事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばらなきゃ！3日間！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不得意な分野ではあるが\n一生懸命頑張るであります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あのね！きょう\nマッサージしに行ったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹を押されてね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ痛いですかー？って言われて\nいたいですーーって答えたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものの食べ過ぎです。\nって怒られたよ(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいよね！甘いの食べてるって話してないのに！\nお腹押して痛いか痛くないか答えたら\nばれちゃうんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロってすっげえーーーー\nっておもった(｀・ω・´)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなはなしを伊織としながらも\n片手に甘～いスティックおかしをもって\n食べてた(｡-_-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものはやめられぬ(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじめっこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/14/5337911/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近全然本読めてないな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読まなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ読んでない新しく買った本が\n3冊くらいあるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー！！！"}],"source":"archive"}